<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Tidux助手</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIconFile</key>
	<string>AppIcon</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>Tidux助手</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key>
	<string>public.app-category.productivity</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Tidux助手使用蓝牙与 iPhone 安全配对，同步设备状态以及你选择的照片和文件。</string>
	<key>NSBonjourServices</key>
	<array>
		<string>_codexsync._tcp</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Tidux助手使用本地网络向已配对的 iPhone 提供端到端加密的双向文件同步。</string>
	<key>NSLocationUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Tidux助手需要定位权限来识别并重新连接你配置的 iPhone 热点；不会获取或保存你的地理位置。</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Tidux助手需要定位权限来识别并重新连接你配置的 iPhone 热点；不会获取或保存你的地理位置。</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Tidux助手仅在你主动开始语音输入后使用麦克风，将语音实时转换为文字。</string>
	<key>NSPrincipalClass</key>
	<string>NSApplication</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Tidux助手使用 Apple 的设备端语音模型转换你主动录制的声音。</string>
</dict>
</plist>
